NAME
    gcloud alpha storage intelligence-findings revisions - historical revisions
        of intelligence findings

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud alpha storage intelligence-findings revisions COMMAND
        [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    (ALPHA) Historical revisions of intelligence findings.

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

COMMANDS
    COMMAND is one of the following:

     describe
        (ALPHA) Historical revision description of a finding.

     list
        (ALPHA) Historical revisions list of a finding.

NOTES
    This command is currently in alpha and might change without notice. If this
    command fails with API permission errors despite specifying the correct
    project, you might be trying to access an API with an invitation-only early
    access allowlist.

